# Pulse-period meter. timer0 (capture mode, aux <- in0.rise) latches the
# clocks between consecutive rising edges on in0; the first edge only
# restarts its count. After each later edge: push the 16-bit period, low
# byte first.
        SETC 4
        CLEAR
        WAIT event:in0.rise         # first edge: the capture count restarts
next:   WAIT event:in0.rise
        RD readback:timer0.capture
        PUSH                        # low byte
        SHR
        SHR
        SHR
        SHR
        SHR
        SHR
        SHR
        SHR
        PUSH                        # high byte
        LOOP next
        HALT
